The '''Phoenix Pet''' is a {{Skl|Combat}} [[Pets|Pet]] obtained by killing any mob on a public island and dungeons. It is an extremely rare drop. It does not grant [[Pet Score]], and therefore also no {{SkyBlock XP}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Phoenix Pet''' is obtained as a rare drop from killing any mob.

