== Tips ==
*The {{Very Special}} version of this pet is generally not worth it, as the additional perks it gives are also provided by a {{Item|Booster Cookie}} (or a {{Item|Piggy Bank}} and {{Item|Magical Mushroom Soup}}).

== Trivia ==
*The first Phoenix Pet was dropped 5 minutes after Pets Update came out.<ref>https://hypixel.net/threads/first-phoenix-pet-in-the-world-rarest-pet.2618534/</ref>
*There was a glitch in which the player could fly on public islands using the Phoenix Pet. It was fixed an hour after the update was released.
*For a time, it was said that this pet had a 0.1% chance of dropping from Special {{MobSprite|Zealot}}s; however, this has been debunked by admins.
*This was the first [[Pet]] added with 4 listed abilities.
*If a player obtains a Phoenix Pet, it is announced to the server with the following message:
*:{{Dialogue|&eWow! [player] found a &cPhoenix &epet!}}
*[[Dungeon Mobs]] can also drop a Phoenix Pet.
*The {{AN|Fourth Flare}} ability deals damage based on the player's {{stat|crit dmg}} stat, not the damage dealt when getting a critical hit.
*The first ability is currently bugged and doesn't protect you from fatal damage dealt by most dungeon mobs.

